(* Standard library: dynamic.be on a type nested 70 deep, compared with a
   descriptor of its own (dynamic.intern's): the comparison is not cut off at
   any depth *)
(* @stdin:
{"quest":1,"types":[
{"tuple":[["x",1]]},
{"tuple":[["x",2]]},
{"tuple":[["x",3]]},
{"tuple":[["x",4]]},
{"tuple":[["x",5]]},
{"tuple":[["x",6]]},
